  "bio": "Arianna Carrarini is an exceptional tattoo artist who specializes in newschool, watercolor, and illustrative styles. Owner and tattooist at Oddity Lab Tattoo, she manages to perfectly blend her love for cartoons and oddities into her unique designs. Not just an artist, Arianna is also recognized as a fervent animal lover and a self-professed lunatic, who brings much flair and distinctive creativity to her work.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\nColor specialist since 2011 \n@oddity.lab.tattoo owner\n📍 Verona (IT)\n✉️ Info & Booking:\nariannacarrarini@gmail.com & DM\n🌘 Weirdo 🌿Nature Lover",
